        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Cuts first-draft time significantly per article</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">ads_click</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Ad Copy Generation &amp; Testing</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Generates multiple ad copy variants for testing across platforms, in your brand voice, ready for quick review before launch.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Enables real creative testing at smaller ad budgets</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">inventory_2</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Product Description Automation</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Generates consistent, on-brand product descriptions at scale from product data, covering catalogs too large to write manually.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Scales with catalog size without a proportional writing cost</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">web</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Website Copy Drafting</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Drafts landing page and website copy aligned with your positioning and voice, speeding up launches for new pages and campaigns.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Speeds up new page and campaign launches</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">style</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Brand Voice Training &amp; Style Guide Enforcement</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Trains content generation on your specific style guide and past work, keeping tone consistent across every writer and channel.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Keeps voice consistent as your content team grows</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">translate</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Multilingual Content Adaptation</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Adapts content for Arabic and English audiences with attention to tone and register, not a literal word-for-word translation.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Tested specifically for natural Arabic phrasing</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:2.5rem;padding:2rem;background:#f9f9ff;border-radius:20px;">
      <p style="color:#00253b;font-weight:700;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Covered by our 100% refund guarantee</p>
      <p style="color:#42474e;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Every piece checked for originality and reviewed by a human editor before publishing.</p>
      <button onclick="openModal(this)" data-source="marketing_content_mid" class="btn-primary">Book Free Content AI Audit</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTENT PLANNING -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="planning-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split-grid split-media-right">
      <div>
        <h2 id="planning-heading" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Planning keeps AI-assisted content on schedule</h2>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:1.0625rem; line-height:1.85; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Faster drafting only helps if the calendar keeps up. AI cuts the time to produce a first draft, but a content team still needs a clear plan for what gets written, when, and for which channel. Without that structure, faster drafting just means a faster-growing backlog.</p>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:1.0625rem; line-height:1.85;">We build the planning layer alongside the drafting tools, a shared calendar tied to your content pipeline, so briefs, drafts, and publish dates stay visible to the whole team instead of living in separate documents.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-media">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506784983877-45594efa4cbe?w=800&h=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Monthly content calendar with goals and a coffee cup on the desk" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- KEY AI APPLICATIONS -->
<section id="applications" class="section" aria-labelledby="apps-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 id="apps-heading">Where AI is having the biggest impact in content writing</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="contentwriting-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Content type categories">
      <button type="button" id="contentwriting-tab-blogseo" class="contentwriting-tab-btn active" data-contentwriting-tab="blogseo" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="contentwriting-panel-blogseo">Blog &amp; SEO Content</button>
      <button type="button" id="contentwriting-tab-social" class="contentwriting-tab-btn" data-contentwriting-tab="social" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="contentwriting-panel-social">Social &amp; Ad Copy</button>
    </div>
    <div class="bento-grid bento-grid-3" id="contentwriting-panel-blogseo" data-contentwriting-tab-panel="blogseo" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="contentwriting-tab-blogseo">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">article</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">AI Blog &amp; Long-Form Content</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Generative writing tools have become a standard part of content production workflows, drafting structure and first content for editors to refine.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">A majority of content marketers now use AI somewhere in production (CMI)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">inventory_2</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Product Description at Scale</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">E-commerce catalogs of any meaningful size now rely on AI-assisted description generation rather than manual writing per SKU.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Standard for catalogs beyond a few hundred SKUs</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">web</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Website &amp; Landing Page Copy</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">AI-assisted drafting speeds up landing page production for campaigns, letting teams launch and test more page variants.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Speeds up campaign launch timelines</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">style</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Brand Voice Consistency Tools</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">AI style-checking tools flag content that drifts from brand guidelines, useful as teams and contributor pools grow.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Helps maintain consistency across distributed teams</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bento-grid bento-grid-3" id="contentwriting-panel-social" data-contentwriting-tab-panel="social" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="contentwriting-tab-social" hidden>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">ads_click</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Ad Copy Generation</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Performance marketing teams use AI to generate copy variants for testing at a volume manual writing couldn't sustain.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Standard practice in most modern paid media workflows</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#006875; font-size:24px;">repeat</span></div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:1.0625rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Content Repurposing Across Formats</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">AI tools adapt a single piece of content into multiple formats, social posts, email, video scripts, from one source article.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem; font-weight:600; color:#006875;">Multiplies the value of every piece of original content</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- EVALUATION CRITERIA -->
<section class="section" style="background:#e7eeff;" aria-labelledby="eval-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 id="eval-heading">What makes content writing AI actually work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="eval-grid">
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="num-circle">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:0.9375rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Factual accuracy</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.8125rem; line-height:1.6;">AI can state things confidently and incorrectly. Every fact, statistic, and claim needs verification before publishing under your brand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="num-circle">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:0.9375rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Brand voice consistency</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.8125rem; line-height:1.6;">Generic AI writing style is easy to spot. Output needs to be trained on your actual voice and past content, not a default tone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="num-circle">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:0.9375rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">SEO and quality signals</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.8125rem; line-height:1.6;">Content still needs to be genuinely useful and well-structured to perform in search, whether AI or a person drafted the first version.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="num-circle">4</div>
        <h3 style="font-weight:700; font-size:0.9375rem; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Human editorial review</h3>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.8125rem; line-height:1.6;">Every piece needs a person to review before it goes out under your brand name, for accuracy, tone, and quality, not just a spell check.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INDUSTRY RESEARCH -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="research-heading">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 id="research-heading">What the data shows about AI in content writing</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ind-stats-grid" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1.5rem; margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <p class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem; margin-bottom:4px;">62%</p>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem;">of marketers have integrated AI into their content strategy (Content Marketing Institute)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <p class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem; margin-bottom:4px;">3&ndash;5x</p>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem;">faster first-draft production with AI-assisted writing</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
        <p class="stat-number" style="font-size:2.25rem; margin-bottom:4px;">100%</p>
        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:0.875rem;">of content passes through human review before publishing in our workflow</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="research-panel">
      <div class="ind-text-grid" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:2rem; font-size:0.875rem;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-weight:700; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Adoption</p>
          <p style="color:#42474e; line-height:1.7;">Content Marketing Institute's annual research consistently finds a majority of marketers now use AI somewhere in their content workflow, most heavily for ideation, first drafts, and repurposing existing material into new formats.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-weight:700; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Production Speed</p>
          <p style="color:#42474e; line-height:1.7;">Teams using AI-assisted drafting consistently report multiplying output volume without a proportional increase in headcount, concentrated in the ideation and first-draft stages of production.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-weight:700; color:#00253b; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Quality Standards</p>
          <p style="color:#42474e; line-height:1.7;">Search engines have stated they evaluate content on quality and usefulness regardless of production method, reinforcing that human editorial review, not the writing tool, remains the deciding factor in content performance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section" style="background:#e7eeff;" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 id="faq-heading">Questions about AI in content writing</h2>
    </div>
    <FaqAccordion items={faqItems} />
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<div class="cta-band">
  <div style="position:relative; z-index:1; text-align:center;">
    <p class="cta-eyebrow">Free Discovery Call</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3vw,2.5rem); margin-bottom:1rem;">Book a Free Content AI Audit</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.125rem; max-width:36rem; margin:0 auto 2rem; line-height:1.7;">We'll assess your content production workflow, and show you exactly what we'd build. No obligation. Most audits take 30 minutes and produce a clear action plan.</p>
    <div class="cta-trust-badges">
      <span class="cta-trust-badge">✓ 100% free</span>
      <span class="cta-trust-badge">✓ No commitment</span>
      <span class="cta-trust-badge">✓ Refund guarantee</span>
    </div>
    <button onclick="openModal(this)" data-source="marketing_content_cta" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:1.125rem; padding:1.125rem 2.75rem;">Book Free Content AI Audit</button>
    <p style="font-size:.875rem; margin-top:1rem; color:#94a3b8;">30-min call · No sales pressure</p>
  </div>
</div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.icon-box { width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:14px; background:rgba(0,227,253,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(0,227,253,0.25); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:1rem; flex-shrink:0; }
    .num-circle { width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(0,227,253,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(0,227,253,0.25); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 1rem; font-size:1.125rem; font-weight:800; color:#006875; }
    .research-panel { background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,37,59,0.10); border-radius:20px; padding:2rem; margin-top:2rem; }
    .apps-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1.5rem; }
    #contentwriting-panel-blogseo { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    #contentwriting-panel-social { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); max-width:700px; margin:0 auto; }
    .eval-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:1.5rem; }
    .contentwriting-tabs { display:flex; gap:0.5rem; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:2rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .contentwriting-tab-btn { padding:0.625rem 1.25rem; border-radius:100px; border:1px solid rgba(0,37,59,0.15); background:#fff; color:#42474e; font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s; }
    .contentwriting-tab-btn:hover { background:#e7eeff; }
    .contentwriting-tab-btn.active { background:#006875; border-color:#006875; color:#fff; }
    .contentwriting-tab-btn:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #006875; outline-offset:2px; }
    @media(max-width:900px) { .apps-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } .eval-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } .ind-stats-grid, .ind-text-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr !important; } }
    @media(max-width:600px) { .apps-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } #contentwriting-panel-blogseo, #contentwriting-panel-social { grid-template-columns:1fr; max-width:none; margin:0; } .eval-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .ind-stats-grid, .ind-text-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr !important; } }
    [data-contentwriting-tab-panel][hidden] { display:none; }
</style>

<script>
  const contentwritingTabWrap = document.querySelector('.contentwriting-tabs');
  if (contentwritingTabWrap) {
    const btns = contentwritingTabWrap.querySelectorAll('.contentwriting-tab-btn');
    const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-contentwriting-tab-panel]');
    btns.forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const key = btn.getAttribute('data-contentwriting-tab');
        btns.forEach((b) => { b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn); b.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(b === btn)); });
        panels.forEach((p) => { (p as HTMLElement).hidden = p.getAttribute('data-contentwriting-tab-panel') !== key; });
      });
    });
  }
</script>
